# Bot1 fills its graveyard with a Wheel of Fortune off a Black Lotus, then casts Abhorrent Oculus by exiling six of
# those cards (CR 118.3). On Bot2's upkeep the Oculus manifests dread (CR 701.62a): of Guerrilla Gorilla and Lightning
# Bolt, the Gorilla goes onto the battlefield face down as a nameless 2/2 and the Bolt into the graveyard.
#
# It stops as Bot1 declares attackers on its next turn, with the face-down Gorilla on the board, to
# picture a face-down permanent.

